{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "hotelling-header",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1690,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n# Hotelling T-squared and mean inference\n\nStart with the sampling model, calibrate a joint mean departure, then interpret projections and confidence regions. Paired and independent-group designs require their own sampling units.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n# Hotelling T² 与多元均值推断\n\n先明确抽样模型，再校准均值的联合偏离；通过投影理解置信区域，按配对或独立分组设计继续。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "hotelling-foundation",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## Gaussian sampling foundations\n\n[[样本协方差Wishart律|Sample covariance has a Wishart law]] and [[正态均值协方差独立|is independent of the sample mean]] under iid joint Gaussian sampling.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\niid 联合 Gaussian 抽样下，样本协方差的 Wishart 律与均值—协方差独立性共同提供精确校准。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "hotelling-one-sample",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[单样本Hotelling T²|One-sample Hotelling test]]\n\nFor $n$ iid observations in $p$ dimensions from $N_p(\\mu,\\Sigma)$, $\\Sigma\\succ0$, $n>p$, and sample covariance $S$ with divisor $n-1$, the null $\\mu=\\mu_0$ gives $\\frac{n-p}{p(n-1)}T^2\\sim F_{p,n-p}$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n$p$ 为变量数，$n$ 为观测数；未知协方差用样本估计，须按所示系数转换。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "hotelling-boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## Sampling and rank conditions\n\n[[Wishart抽样假设|Joint Gaussian iid assumptions]] give the exact law; [[Wishart秩与可逆性|rank and invertibility]] decide whether the ordinary inverse exists.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n抽样假设决定精确分布，秩条件决定普通逆是否存在；两件事须分别核对。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hotelling-paired",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[配对Hotelling T²|Paired Hotelling test]]\n\nForm $D_i=X_i-Y_i$ within each pair. Apply the one-sample test when the $n$ differences are iid $N_p(\\delta,\\Sigma_D)$, $\\Sigma_D\\succ0$, $n>p$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n$n$ 数的是对数；精确检验针对独立同分布的正态差向量。同一对内部可相关，相关性进入差的协方差。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "hotelling-projection",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hotelling投影极值|Largest projected departure]]\n\nFor $d=\\bar X-\\mu_0$ and $S\\succ0$, $T^2=\\max_{a\\ne0}n(a^Td)^2/(a^TSa)$. A joint rejection is evidence against the target, possibly through a combination.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n全局证据可以来自某个线性组合，不表示每个坐标都显著；最大方向不能套用单一固定方向的阈值。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "hotelling-two-sample",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[pooled Hotelling T²|Pooled two-sample test]]\n\nTwo independent iid Gaussian groups share $\\Sigma\\succ0$. Pool within-group residuals into $S_p$. For group sizes $n_1,n_2\\ge2$, $p$ variables and $m=n_1+n_2-2\\ge p$, the null-scaled statistic follows $F_{p,m-p+1}$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n两组各有 $n_1,n_2$ 个观测；合并组内变动，按正文系数校准。共同协方差是这里的模型条件。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "hotelling-linear",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 390,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[线性约束Hotelling T²|Fixed linear restrictions]]\n\nFix $D\\mu=\\psi_0$ before observing the data. With $D$ full row rank $m$, transform to $DX_i$ and test in $m$ dimensions. Under the stated Gaussian model, $n>m$ suffices even if the original sample covariance is singular.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先核对约束相容性、删去冗余行，再按实际秩 $m$ 推断；变换和目标要一起保留。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "hotelling-ellipsoid",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hotelling置信椭球|Mean confidence ellipsoid]]\n\nInverting the same test gives a region for the mean parameter. Its projections cover all $a^T\\mu$ simultaneously through one event.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n同一置信椭球的全部方向区间同时覆盖；仅查看坐标区间会丢失部分联合约束。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "hotelling-bonferroni",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 390,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Bonferroni对比区间|Bonferroni intervals]]\n\nFor a fixed finite family of mean combinations, divide total error $\\alpha$ among valid marginal intervals. Their joint coverage is at least $1-\\alpha$, without requiring independent failures or an inverse sample covariance. A displayed subset stays protected; newly selected directions do not automatically inherit the guarantee.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n预设有限组得到同时覆盖后，可展示其子集；看数据后新增方向不会自动得到原保证。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0021-hotelling-f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1720,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[F分布|F distribution]]\n\nFor independent $U\\sim\\chi_r^2$, $V\\sim\\chi_s^2$ with $r,s>0$, $(U/r)/(V/s)\\sim F_{r,s}$. The parameter order follows numerator then denominator.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n两个独立卡方量先各除以自由度再取比值；分子、分母自由度顺序不能交换。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0022-hotelling-t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1720,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Student t分布|Student t distribution]]\n\nIf $Z\\sim N(0,1)$ and $V\\sim\\chi^2_\\nu$ are independent, $T=Z/\\sqrt{V/\\nu}\\sim t_\\nu$, $\\nu>0$. Its heavier tails reflect uncertainty in the denominator.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n独立的正态量除以随机尺度；$\\nu$ 是自由度。双侧区间把错误率分到两条尾部。"
    }
  ],
